---Describes the user, app, client, or other entity (actor) who performs an action on a target. The actor is dependent on the action that is performed. All events have actors.
---@class okta.LogActor
---@field alternateId? string Alternative ID of the actor
---@field detailEntry? okta.LogActorDetailEntryMap Further details about the actor
---@field displayName? string Display name of the actor
---@field id? string ID of the actor
---@field type? string Type of actor

---Further details about the actor
