---@field postalCode? string Postal code of the area that encompasses the geolocation coordinates
---@field state? string Full name of the state or province that encompasses the area that contains the geolocation coordinates (for example, Montana, Ontario)

---The latitude and longitude of the geolocation where an action was performed. The object is formatted according to the [ISO 6709](https://www.iso.org/obp/ui/fr/#iso:std:iso:6709:ed-3:v1:en) standard.
